006491,000153:                                                                                          	# THE STATUS OF THE PROCEED PUSHBUTTON IS MONITORED EVERY 120 MILLISECONDS VIA THE CHANNEL 32 BIT 14 INBIT.
006492,000154:                                                                                          	#  THE STATE OF THIS INBIT IS COMPARED WITH ITS STATE DURING THE PREVIOUS T4RUPT AND IS PROCESSED AS FOLLOWS.
006493,000155:                                                                                          	#       IF PREV ON AND NOW ON   - BYPASS
006494,000156:                                                                                          	#       IF PREV ON AND NOW OFF  - UPDATE IMODES33
006495,000157:                                                                                          	#       IF PREV OFF AND NOW ON  - UPDATE IMODES33 AND PROCESS VIA PINBALL
006496,000158:                                                                                          	#       IF PREV OFF AND NOW OFF - BYPASS
006497,000159:                                                                                          	# THE LOGIC EMPLOYED REQUIRES ONLY 9 MCT (APPROX. 108 MICROSECONDS) OF COMPUTER TIME WHEN NO CHANGES OCCUR.
