007708,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Lunar Module's (LM)
007709,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
007710,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
007711,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Hartmuth Gutsche <hgutsche@xplornet.com>.
007712,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
007713,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       190-192
007714,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-19 HG   Transcribed from page images.
007715,000012:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-13 RSB  Proofed text comments with octopus/ProoferComments
