007719,000016: 
007720,000017:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from
007721,000018:                                                                                          	## digitized images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization
007722,000019:                                                                                          	## was performed by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of
007723,000020:                                                                                          	## the Museum.  Many thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction
007724,000021:                                                                                          	## in storage size and consequent reduction in image quality as well) are
