007726,000023:                                                                                          	## find that the images are illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org
007727,000024:                                                                                          	## about getting access to the (much) higher-quality images which Paul
007728,000025:                                                                                          	## actually created.
007729,000026:                                                                                          	##
007730,000027:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
007731,000028:                                                                                          	##
007732,000029:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 001 of AGC program LMY99 by NASA 2021112-61
007733,000030:                                                                                          	##      16:27 JULY 14, 1969 
007734,000031: 
007736,000033:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM DESCRIPTION
007737,000034: 
007738,000035:                                                                                          	# AUTHOR: J S MILLER
007739,000036: 
007740,000037:                                                                                          	# MODIFIED 6 MARCH 1968 BY P S WEISSMAN TO SET UP JOB FOR 1/ACCS WHEN THE MASKS ARE CHANGED.
007741,000038: 
007742,000039:                                                                                          	# THIS ROUTINE IS ATTACHED TO T4RUPT, AND IS ENTERED EVERY 480 MS.  ITS FUNCTION IS TO EXAMINE THE LOW 8 BITS
007743,000040:                                                                                          	# OF CHANNEL 32 TO SEE IF ANY ISOLATION-VALVE CLOSURE BITS HAVE APPEARED OR DISAPPEARED (THE CREW IS WARNED OF JET
007744,000041:                                                                                          	# FAILURES BY LAMPS LIT BY THE GRUMMAN FAILURE-DETECTION CIRCUITRY; THEY MAY RESPOND BY OPERATING SWITCHES WHICH
007745,000042:                                                                                          	# ISOLATE PAIRS OF JETS FROM THE PROPELLANT TANKS AND SET BITS IN CHANNEL 32).  IN THE EVENT THAT CHANNEL 32 BITS
007746,000043:                                                                                          	# DIFFER FROM 'PVALVEST', THE RECORD OF ACTIONS TAKEN BY THIS ROUTINE, THE APPROPRIATE BITS IN 'CH5MASK' &
007747,000044:                                                                                          	# 'CH6MASK', USED BY THE DAP JET-SELECTION LOGIC, ARE UPDATED, AS IS 'PVALVEST'.  TO SPEED UP & SHORTEN THE
007748,000045:                                                                                          	# ROUTINE, NO MORE THAN ONE CHANGE IS ACCEPTED PER ENTRY.  THE HIGHEST-NUMBERED BIT IN CHANNEL 32 WHICH REQUIRES
007749,000046:                                                                                          	# ACTION IS THE ONE PROCESSED.
007750,000047: 
007751,000048:                                                                                          	# THE CODING IN THE FAILURE MONITOR HAS BEEN WRITTEN SO AS TO HAVE ALMOST COMPLETE RESTART PROTECTION.  FOR
007752,000049:                                                                                          	# EXAMPLE, NO ASSUMPTION IS MADE WHEN SETTING A 'CH5MASK' BIT TO 1 THAT THE PREVIOUS STATE IS 0, ALTHOUGH IT OF
007753,000050:                                                                                          	# COURSE SHOULD BE.  ONE CASE WHICH MAY BE SEEN TO EVADE PROTECTION IS THE OCCURRENCE OF A RESTART AFTER UPDATING
007754,000051:                                                                                          	# ONE OR BOTH DAP MASK-WORDS BUT BEFORE UPDATING 'PVALVEST', COUPLED WITH A CHANGE IN THE VALVE-BIT BACK TO ITS
007755,000052:                                                                                          	# FORMER STATE.  THE CONSEQUENCE OF THIS IS THAT THE NEXT ENTRY WOULD NOT SEE THE CHANGE INCOMPLETELY INCORP-
007756,000053:                                                                                          	# ORATED BY THE LAST PASS (BECAUSE IT WENT AWAY AT JUST THE RIGHT TIME), BUT THE DAP MASK-WORDS WILL BE INCORRECT.
007757,000054:                                                                                          	# THIS COMBINATION OF EVENTS SEEMS QUITE REMOTE, BUT NOT IMPOSSIBLE UNLESS THE CREW OPERATES THE SWITCHES AT HALF-
007758,000055:                                                                                          	# SECOND INTERVALS OR LONGER.  IN ANY EVENT, A DISAGREEMENT BETWEEN REALITY AND THE DAP MASKS WILL BE CURED IF
007759,000056:                                                                                          	# THE MISINTERPRETED SWITCH IS REVERSED AND THEN RESTORED TO ITS CORRECT POSITION (SLOWLY).
007760,000057: 
007761,000058:                                                                                          	# CALLING SEQUENCE:
007762,000059: 
007763,000060:                                                                                          	#       TCF     RCSMONIT                (IN INTERRUPT MODE, EVERY 480 MS.)
007764,000061: 
007765,000062:                                                                                          	# EXIT: TCF RCSMONEX (ALL PATHS EXIT VIA SUCH AN INSTRUCTION)
007766,000063: 
007767,000064: 06,3156     5270               RCSMONEX           EQUALS   RESUME                        	#
007768,000065: 
007769,000066:                                                                                          	# ERASABLE INITIALIZATION REQUIRED:
007770,000067: 
007771,000068:                                                                                          	#       VIA FRESH START:        PVALVEST        =       +0      (ALL JETS ENABLED)
007772,000069:                                                                                          	#                               CH5MASK,CH6MASK =       +0      (ALL JETS OK)
007773,000070: 
007774,000071:                                                                                          	# OUTPUT:       CH5MASK & CH6MASK UPDATED (1'S WHERE JETS NOT TO BE USED, IN CHANNEL 5 & 6 FORMAT)
007775,000072:                                                                                          	#               PVALTEST UPDATED (1,S WHEN VALVE CLOSURES HAVE BEEN TRANSLATED INTO CH5MASK & CH6MASK; CHAN 32 FORMAT)
007776,000073:                                                                                          	#               JOB TO DO 1/ACCS.
007777,000074: 
007778,000075:                                                                                          	# DEBRIS:  A, L, Q AND DEBRIS OF NOVAC.
007779,000076: 
007780,000077:                                                                                          	# SUBROUTINE CALLED:  NOVAC.
007781,000078: 
007782,000079: 06,3156     1262                                  EBANK=   CH5MASK                       	#
007783,000080: 
007784,000081: 23,2000                                           BANK     23                            	#
007785,000082: 06,2000                                           SETLOC   RCSMONT                       	#
007786,000083: 06,2000                                           BANK                                   	#
007788,000085: 06,3156                                           COUNT*   $$/T4RCS                      	#
007789,000086: 
007790,000087: 06,3156  06,3156               RCSMONIT           EQUALS   RCSMON                        	#
007791,000088: 
007792,000089: 06,3156           44755        RCSMON             CS       ZERO                          	#
007793,000090: 06,3157           00006                           EXTEND                                 	#
007794,000091: 06,3160           06032                           RXOR     CHAN32                        	# PICK UP + INVERT INVERTED CHANNEL 32.
007795,000092: 06,3161           74357                           MASK     LOW8                          	# KEEP JET-FAIL BITS ONLY.
007796,000093: 06,3162           54002                           TS       Q                             	#
007797,000094: 
007798,000095: 06,3163           41276                           CS       PVALVEST                      	#       -   -
007799,000096: 06,3164           70002                           MASK     Q                             	# FORM PC + PC.
007800,000097: 06,3165           54001                           TS       L                             	#       (P = PREVIOUS ISOLATION VALVE STATE,
007801,000098: 06,3166           40002                           CS       Q                             	#        C = CURRENT VALVE STATE (CH32)).
007802,000099: 06,3167           71276                           MASK     PVALVEST                      	#
007803,000100: 06,3170           26001                           ADS      L                             	# RESULT NZ INDICATES ACTION REQUIRED.
007804,000101: 
007805,000102: 06,3171           00006                           EXTEND                                 	#
007806,000103: 06,3172           15270                           BZF      RCSMONEX                      	# QUIT IF NO ACTION REQUIRED.
007807,000104: 
007808,000105: 06,3173           00006                           EXTEND                                 	#
007809,000106: 06,3174           74745                           MP       BIT7                          	# MOVE BITS 8-1 OF A TO 14-7 OF L.
007810,000107: 06,3175           56001                           XCH      L                             	# ZERO TO L IN THE PROCESS.
007811,000108: 
007812,000109: 06,3176           24001                 -3        INCR     L                             	#
007813,000110: 06,3177           60000                           DOUBLE                                 	# BOUND TO GET OVERFLOW IN THIS LOOP,
007814,000111: 06,3200           54000                           OVSK                                   	# SINCE WE ASSURED INITIAL NZ IN A.
007815,000112: 06,3201           13176                           TCF      -3                            	#
007816,000113: 
007817,000114: 06,3202           50001                           INDEX    L                             	#
007818,000115: 06,3203           34743                           CA       BIT8       -1                 	# SAVE THE RELEVANT BIT (8-1).
007819,000116: 06,3204           54002                           TS       Q                             	#
007820,000117: 06,3205           71276                           MASK     PVALVEST                      	# LOOK AT PREVIOUS VALVE STATE BIT.
007821,000118: 06,3206           10000                           CCS      A                             	#
007822,000119: 06,3207           13223                           TCF      VOPENED                       	# THE VALVE HAS JUST BEEN OPENED.
007823,000120: 
007824,000121: 06,3210           41262                           CS       CH5MASK                       	# THE VALVE HAS JUST BEEN CLOSED.
007825,000122: 06,3211           50001                           INDEX    L                             	#
007826,000123: 06,3212           73242                           MASK     5FAILTAB                      	#
007827,000124: 06,3213           27262                           ADS      CH5MASK                       	# SET INHIBIT BIT FOR CHANNEL 5 JET.
007828,000125: 
007829,000126: 06,3214           41263                           CS       CH6MASK                       	#
007830,000127: 06,3215           50001                           INDEX    L                             	#
007831,000128: 06,3216           73252                           MASK     6FAILTAB                      	#
007832,000129: 06,3217           27263                           ADS      CH6MASK                       	# SET INGIBIT BIT FOR CHANNEL 6 JET.
007833,000130: 
007834,000131: 06,3220           30002                           CA       Q                             	#
007835,000132: 06,3221           27276                           ADS      PVALVEST                      	# RECORD ACTION TAKEN.
007836,000133: 
007837,000134: 06,3222           13236                           TCF      1/ACCFIX                      	# SET UP 1/ACCJOB AND EXIT.
007838,000135: 
007840,000137: 06,3223           50001        VOPENED            INDEX    L                             	# A VALVE HAS JUST BEEN OPENED.
007841,000138: 06,3224           43242                           CS       5FAILTAB                      	#
007842,000139: 06,3225           71262                           MASK     CH5MASK                       	#
007843,000140: 06,3226           55262                           TS       CH5MASK                       	# REMOVE INHIBIT BIT FOR CHANNEL 5 JET.
007844,000141: 
007845,000142: 06,3227           50001                           INDEX    L                             	#
007846,000143: 06,3230           43252                           CS       6FAILTAB                      	#
007847,000144: 06,3231           71263                           MASK     CH6MASK                       	#
007848,000145: 06,3232           55263                           TS       CH6MASK                       	# REMOVE INHIBIT BIT FOR CHANNEL 6 JET.
007849,000146: 
007850,000147: 06,3233           40002                           CS       Q                             	#
007851,000148: 06,3234           71276                           MASK     PVALVEST                      	#
007852,000149: 06,3235           55276                           TS       PVALVEST                      	# RECORD ACTION TAKEN.
007853,000150: 
007854,000151: 06,3236           37715        1/ACCFIX           CAF      PRIO27                        	# SET UP 1/ACCS SO THAT THE SWITCH CURVES
007855,000152: 06,3237           05072                           TC       NOVAC                         	#       FOR TJETLAW CAN BE MODIFIED IF CH5MASK
007856,000153: 06,3240  E6,1537                                  EBANK=   AOSQ                          	#       HAS BEEN ALTERED.
007857,000154: 06,3240           02454 40106                     2CADR    1/ACCJOB                      	#
007858,000155: 
007859,000156: 06,3242           15270                           TCF      RCSMONEX                      	# EXIT.
007860,000157: 
007861,000158: 06,3243                        5FAILTAB           EQUALS   -1                            	# CH 5 JET BIT CORRESPONDING TO CH 32 BIT:
007862,000159: 06,3243           00040                           OCT      00040                         	# 8
007863,000160: 06,3244           00020                           OCT      00020                         	# 7
007864,000161: 06,3245           00100                           OCT      00100                         	# 6
007865,000162: 06,3246           00200                           OCT      00200                         	# 5
007866,000163: 06,3247           00010                           OCT      00010                         	# 4
007867,000164: 06,3250           00001                           OCT      00001                         	# 3
007868,000165: 06,3251           00004                           OCT      00004                         	# 2
007869,000166: 06,3252           00002                           OCT      00002                         	# 1
007870,000167: 
007871,000168: 06,3253                        6FAILTAB           EQUALS   -1                            	# CH 6 JET BIT CORRESPONDING TO CH 32 BIT:
007872,000169: 06,3253           00010                           OCT      00010                         	# 8
007873,000170: 06,3254           00020                           OCT      00020                         	# 7
007874,000171: 06,3255           00004                           OCT      00004                         	# 6
007875,000172: 06,3256           00200                           OCT      00200                         	# 5
007876,000173: 06,3257           00001                           OCT      00001                         	# 4
007877,000174: 06,3260           00002                           OCT      00002                         	# 3
007878,000175: 06,3261           00040                           OCT      00040                         	# 2
007879,000176: 06,3262           00100                           OCT      00100                         	# 1
007880,000177: 
007881,000178: 
(End of include-file RCS_FAILURE_MONITOR.agc, resuming MAIN.agc)
