009233,000674:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM NAME          V37                     ASSEMBLY SUNDANCE
009234,000675: 
009235,000676:                                                                                          	# LOG SECTION           FRESH START AND RESTART
009236,000677: 
009237,000678:                                                                                          	# FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION
009238,000679: 
009239,000680:                                                                                          	#       1. CHECK IF NEW PROGRAM ALLOWED.  IF BIT 1 OF FLAGWRD2 (NODOFLAG) IS SET, AN ALARM 1520 IS CALLED.
009240,000681:                                                                                          	#       2. CHECK FOR VALIDITY OF PROGRAM SELECTED.  IF AN INVALID PROGRAM IS SELECTED, THE OPERATOR ERROR LIGHT IS
009241,000682:                                                                                          	#          SET AND CURRENT ACTIVITY, IF ANY, CONTINUE.
009242,000683:                                                                                          	#       3. SERVICER IS TERMINATED IF IT HAS BEEN RUNNING.
009243,000684:                                                                                          	#       4. INSTALL IS EXECUTED TO AVOID INTERRUPTING INTEGRATION.
009244,000685:                                                                                          	#       5. THE ENGINE IS TURNED OFF AND THE DAP IS INITIALIZED FOR COAST.
009245,000686:                                                                                          	#       6. TRACK AND UPDATE FLAGS ARE SET TO ZERO.
009246,000687:                                                                                          	#       7. DISPLAY SYSTEM IS RELEASED.
009247,000688:                                                                                          	#       8. THE FOLLOWING ARE PERFORMED FOR EACH OF THE THREE CASES.
009248,000689:                                                                                          	#               A. PROGRAM SELECTED IS P00
009249,000690:                                                                                          	#                       1. RENDEZVOUS AND P25 FLAGS ARE RESET.  (KILL P20 AND P25)
009250,000691:                                                                                          	#                       2. STATINT1 IS SCHEDULED BY SETTING RESTART GROUP 2.
009251,000692:                                                                                          	#                       3. MAJOR MODE 00 IS STORED IN THE MODE REGISTER (MODREG).
009252,000693:                                                                                          	#                       4. SUPERBANK 3 IS SELECTED.
009253,000694:                                                                                          	#                       5. NODOFLAG IS RESET.
009254,000695:                                                                                          	#                       6. ALL RESTART GROUPS EXCEPT GROUP2 ARE CLEARED. CONTROL IS TRANSFERRED TO RESTART PROGRAM (GOPROG2)
009255,000696:                                                                                          	#                          WHICH CAUSES ALL CURRENT ACTIVITY TO BE DISCONTINUED AND A 9 MINUTE INTEGRATION CYCLE TO BE
009256,000697:                                                                                          	#                          INITIATED.
009257,000698:                                                                                          	#               B. PROGRAM SELECTES IS P20 OR P25.
009258,000699:                                                                                          	#                       1. IF THE CURRENT MAJOR MODE IS THE SAME AS THE SELECTED NEWPROGRAM.  THE PROGRAM IS RE-INITIALIZED
009259,000700:                                                                                          	#                          VIA V37XEQ, ALL RESTART GROUPS, EXCEPT GROUP 4 ARE CLEARED.
009260,000701:                                                                                          	#                       2. IF THE CURRENT MAJOR MODE IS NOT EQUAL TO THE NEW REQUEST, A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE REQUEST-
009261,000702:                                                                                          	#                          ED MAJOR MODE HAS BEEN RUNNING THE BACKGROUND,
009262,000703:                                                                                          	#                          AND IF IT HAS, NO NEW PROGRAM IS SCHEDULED, THE EXISTING
009263,000704:                                                                                          	#                          P20 OR P25 IS RESTARTED TO CONTINUE, AND ITS MM IS SET.
009264,000705:                                                                                          	#                       3. CONTROL IS TRANSFERRED TO GOPROG2.
009265,000706:                                                                                          	#               C. PROGRAM SELECTED IS NEITHER P00, P20, NOR P25
009266,000707:                                                                                          	#                       1. V37XEQ IS SCHEDULED (AS A JOB) BY SETTING RESTART GROUP 4
009267,000708:                                                                                          	#                       2. ALL CURRENT ACTIVITY EXCEPT RENDEZVOUS AND TRACKING IS DISCONTINUED BY CLEARING ALL RESTART
009268,000709:                                                                                          	#                          GROUPS.  IF THE RENDEZVOUS OR THE P25 FLAG IS ON, GROUP 2 IS NOT CLEARED, ALLOWING THESE PROGRAMS
009269,000710:                                                                                          	#                          TO CONTINUE.
009270,000711: 
009271,000712:                                                                                          	# INPUT/OUTPUT INFORMATION
009272,000713: 
009273,000714:                                                                                          	#       A. CALLING SEQUENCE
009274,000715:                                                                                          	#               CONTROL IS DIRECTED TO V37 BY THE VERBFAN ROUTINE.
009275,000716:                                                                                          	#               VERBFAN GOES TO C(VERBTAB+C(VERBREG)). VERB 37 = MMCHANG.
009276,000717:                                                                                          	#               MMCHANG EXECUTES A `TC POSTJUMP', CADR V37.
009277,000718: 
009278,000719:                                                                                          	#       B. ERASABLE INITIALIZATION              NONE
009279,000720: 
009280,000721:                                                                                          	#       C. OUTPUT
009281,000722:                                                                                          	# Page 227
