009607,001048:                                                                                          	# FOR VERB 37 TWO TABLES ARE MAINTAINED.  EACH TABLE HAS AN ETRY FOR EACH
009608,001049:                                                                                          	# MAJOR MODE THAT CAN BE STARTED FROM THE KEYBOARD.  THE ENTRIES ARE PUT
009609,001050:                                                                                          	# INTO THE TABLE WITH THE ENTRY FOR THE HIGHEST MAJOR MODE COMING FIRST,
009610,001051:                                                                                          	# TO THE LOWEST MAJOR MODE WHICH IS THE LAST ENTRY IN EACH TABLE.
009611,001052: 
