010265,000169:                                                                                          	# THE OPTAXIS SUBROUTINE COMPUTES THE X AND Y MARK PLANE VECS AND
010266,000170:                                                                                          	# AND ROTATES THEM THRU THE APPARENT FIELD OF VIEW ROTATION UNIQUE TO AOT
010267,000171:                                                                                          	# OPTAXIS USES OANB TO COMPUTE THE OPTIC AXIS
