012515,000026:                                                                                          	## digitized images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization
012516,000027:                                                                                          	## was performed by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of
012517,000028:                                                                                          	## the Museum.  Many thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction
012518,000029:                                                                                          	## in storage size and consequent reduction in image quality as well) are
012519,000030:                                                                                          	## available online at www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you
012520,000031:                                                                                          	## find that the images are illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org
012521,000032:                                                                                          	## about getting access to the (much) higher-quality images which Paul
012522,000033:                                                                                          	## actually created.
