018226,001747:                                                                                          	# LOAD VERBS            IF ALARM CONDITION IS DETECTED DURING EXECUTE,
018227,001748:                                                                                          	# CHECK FAIL LIGHT IS TURNED ON AND ENDOFJOB.  IF ALARM CONDITION IS
018228,001749:                                                                                          	# DETECTED DURING ENTER OF DATA, CHECK FAIL IS TURNED ON AND IT RECYCLES
018229,001750:                                                                                          	# TO EXECUTE OF ORIGINAL LOAD VERB.  RECYCLE CAUSED BY  1) DECIMAL MACHINE
018230,001751:                                                                                          	# CADR  2) MIXTURE OF OCTAL/DECIMAL DATA  3) OCTAL DATA INTO DECIMAL
