023412,002216: 
023414,002218:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM NAME_  STARTDES                                                       STORED AS A HALF-UNIT VECTOR IN RRTARGET
023415,002219: 
023416,002220:                                                                                          	# FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION_                                                       CKON IS DESIRED. BIT14 OF RADMODES IS
023417,002221:                                                                                          	#       STARTDES IS ENTERED WHEN WE ARE READY TO BEGIN DESIGNATION.             OR REPOSITION OPERATION. IN THIS
023418,002222:                                                                                          	#       BIT 14 OF RADMODES IS ALREADY SET IF A REMODE IS REQUIRED.              THE REPOSITION WILL BE INTERRUPTED.
023419,002223:                                                                                          	#       AT THIS TIME, THE RR ANTENNA MAY BE IN A REPOSITION                     GINS.
023420,002224:                                                                                          	#       OPERATION.  IN THIS CASE, IF A REMODE IS REQUIRED IT MAY HAVE
023421,002225:                                                                                          	#       ALREADY BEGUN BUT IN ANY CASE THE REPOSITION WILL BE INTERRUPTED.
023422,002226:                                                                                          	#       OTHERWISE, THE REPOSITION WILL BE COMPLETED BEFORE 2-AXIS
023423,002227:                                                                                          	#       DESIGNATION BEGINS.  INITIALLY DESCOUNT IS SET = 60 TO INDICATE
023424,002228:                                                                                          	#       THAT 30 SECONDS WILL BE ALLOWED FOR THE RR DATA GOOD INBIT
023425,002229:                                                                                          	#       (CHAN 33 BIT 4) IF LOCK-ON IS DESIRED (STATE BIT 5).  BIT 10
023426,002230:                                                                                          	#       OF RADMODES IS SET TO SHOW THAT A DESIGNATE IS REQUIRED.
023427,002231:                                                                                          	#       THE REPOSITION FLAG (RADMODES BIT 11) IS CHECKED.  IF SET,
023428,002232:                                                                                          	#       THE PROGRAM EXITS TO L+3 OF THE CALLING PROGRAM (SEE RRDESSM
023429,002233:                                                                                          	#       AND RRDESNB).  THE PROGRAM WILL BEGIN DESIGNATING TO THE DESIRED
023430,002234:                                                                                          	#       ANGLES FOLLOWING THE REPOSITION OR REMODE IF ONE WAS
023431,002235:                                                                                          	#       REQUESTED.  IF THE REPOSITION FLAG IS NOT SET, SETRRECR IS CALLED
023432,002236:                                                                                          	#       WHICH SETS THE RR ERROR COUNTER ENABLE BIT (CHAN 12 BIT 2)
023433,002237:                                                                                          	#       AND SETS LASTYCMD AND LASTXCMD = 0 TO INDICATE THE
023434,002238:                                                                                          	#       DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE PRESENT AND DESIRED STATE OF THE ERROR
023435,002239:                                                                                          	#       COUNTERS.  A 20 MILLISECOND WAITLIST CALL IS SET FOR BEGDES
023436,002240:                                                                                          	#       AFTER WHICH THE PROGRAM EXITS TO L+3 OF THE CALLING PROGRAM.
