023585,002389: 
023587,002391:                                                                                          	# PROGRAM NAME_  BEGDES
023588,002392: 
023589,002393:                                                                                          	# FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION_
023590,002394: 
023591,002395:                                                                                          	#       BEGDES CHECKS VARIOUS DESIGNATE REQUESTS AND REQUESTS THE
023592,002396:                                                                                          	#       ACTUAL RR DESIGNATION.  INITIALLY A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF A
023593,002397:                                                                                          	#       REMODE (RADMODES BIT 14) IS REQUESTED OR IN PROGRESS.  IF SO,
023594,002398:                                                                                          	#       CONTROL IS TRANSFERRED TO STDESIG AFTER ROUTINE REMODE IS
023595,002399:                                                                                          	#       EXECUTED.  IF NO REMODE, STDESIG IS IMMEDIATELY CALLED WHERE
023596,002400:                                                                                          	#       FIRST THE REPOSITION FLAG (RADMODES BIT 11) IS CHECKED.  IF
023597,002401:                                                                                          	#       PRESENT, THE DESIGNATE FLAG (RADMODES BIT 10) IS REMOVED
023598,002402:                                                                                          	#       AFTER WHICH THE PROGRAM EXITS TO RDBADEND.  IF THE REPOSITION
023599,002403:                                                                                          	#       FLAG IS NOT PRESENT, THE CONTINUOUS DESIGNATE FLAG (RADMODES
023600,002404:                                                                                          	#       BIT 15) IS CHECKED.  IF PRESENT, ON EXECUTIVE CALL IS IMMEDIATELY
023601,002405:                                                                                          	#       MADE FOR DODES AFTER WHICH A .5 SECOND WAIT IS INITIATED BEFORE
023602,002406:                                                                                          	#       REPEATING AT STDESIG.  IF THE RR SEARCH ROUTINE (LRS24.1) IS DESIGNATING
023603,002407:                                                                                          	#       TO A NEW POINT (NEWPTFLG SET) THE CURRENT DESIGNATE TASK IS TERMINATED.
023604,002408:                                                                                          	#       IF CONTINUOUS DESIGNATE IS NOT WANTED, THE DESIGNATE FLAG (RADMODES
023605,002409:                                                                                          	#       BIT 10) IS CHECKED.  IF NOT PRESENT, THE PROGRAM EXITS TO ENDRADAR TO
023606,002410:                                                                                          	#       CHECK RR CDU FAIL BEFORE RETURNING TO THE CALLING PROGRAM.  IF DESIGNATE
023607,002411:                                                                                          	#       IS STILL REQUIRED, DESCOUNT IS CHECKED TO SEE IF THE 30 SECONDS HAS
023608,002412:                                                                                          	#       EXPIRED BEFORE RECEIVING THE RR DATA GOOD (CHAN 33 BIT 4)
023609,002413:                                                                                          	#       SIGNAL.  IF OUT OF TIME, PROGRAM ALARM 00503 IS REQUESTED, THE
023610,002414:                                                                                          	#       RR AUTO TRACKER ENABLE AND RR ERROR COUNTER ENABLE
023611,002415:                                                                                          	#       (CHAN 12 BITS 14,2) BITS REMOVED, AND THE DESIGNATE FLAG
023612,002416:                                                                                          	#       (RADMODES BIT 10) REMOVED BEFORE EXITING TO RDBADEND.  IF
023613,002417:                                                                                          	#       TIME HAS NOT EXPIRED, DESCOUNT IS DECREMENTED, THE
023614,002418:                                                                                          	#       EXECUTIVE CALL MADE FOR DODES, AND A .5 SECOND WAIT INITIATED
023615,002419:                                                                                          	#       BEFORE REPEATING THIS PROCEDURE AT STDESIG.
023616,002420: 
023617,002421:                                                                                          	# CALLING SEQUENCE:
023618,002422: 
023619,002423:                                                                                          	#       WAITLIST CALL FROM STARTDES
023620,002424:                                                                                          	#       TCF BEGDES FROM DORREPOS
023621,002425:                                                                                          	#       TC STDESIG RETURNING, FROM REMODE
023622,002426: 
