024684,003488: 24,3336           65545        30DEGCHK           DLOAD    ACOS                          	# THE SPACECRAFT +Z AXIS
024685,003489: 24,3337           03745                                    RRBORSIT   +4                 	# BY TAKING ARCCOS OF Z-COMP. OF THE RR
024686,003490:                                                                                          	# LOS VECTOR, A HALF UNIT VECTOR
024687,003491:                                                                                          	# IN NAV BASE AXES)
