030459,000028:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
030460,000029:                                                                                          	##
030461,000030:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 001 of AGC program LMY99 by NASA 2021112-61
030462,000031:                                                                                          	##      16:27 JULY 14, 1969 
030463,000032: 
030465,000034:                                                                                          	# 1)    PROGRAM NAME - TARGET DELTA V PROGRAM (P76).
030466,000035:                                                                                          	# 2)    FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION - UPON ENTRY BY ASTRONAUT ACTION, P76 FLASHES DSKY REQUESTS TO THE ASTRONAUT
030467,000036:                                                                                          	#       TO PROVIDE VIA DSKY (1) THE DELTA V TO BE APPLIED TO THE OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR AND (2) THE
030468,000037:                                                                                          	#       TIME (TIG) AT WHICH THE OTHER VEHICLE VELOCITY WAS CHANGED BY EXECUTION OF A THRUSTING MANEUVER. THE
030469,000038:                                                                                          	#       OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR IS INTEGRATED TO TIG AND UPDATED BY THE ADDITION OF DELTA V (DELTA V HAVING
030470,000039:                                                                                          	#       BEEN TRANSFORMED FROM LV TO REF COSYS).  USING INTEGRVS, THE PROGRAM THEN INTEGRATES THE OTHER
030471,000040:                                                                                          	#       VEHICLE STATE VECTOR TO THE STATE VECTOR OF THIS VEHICLE, THUS INSURING THAT THE W-MATRIX AND BOTH VEHICLE
030472,000041:                                                                                          	#       STATES CORRESPOND TO THE SAME TIME.
030473,000042:                                                                                          	# 3)    ERASABLE INITIALIZATION REQUIRED - NONE.
030474,000043:                                                                                          	# 4)    CALLING SEQUENCES AND EXIT MODES - CALLED BY ASTRONAUT REQUEST THRU DSKY V 37 E 76E.
030475,000044:                                                                                          	#       EXITS BY TCF ENDOFJOB.
030476,000045:                                                                                          	# 5)    OUTPUT - OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR INTEGRATED TO TIG AND INCREMENTED BY DELTA V IN REF COSYS.
030477,000046:                                                                                          	#       THE PUSHLIST CONTAINS THE MATRIX BY WHICH THE INPUT DELTA V MUST BE POST-MULTIPLIED TO CONVERT FROM LV
030478,000047:                                                                                          	#       TO REF COSYS.
030479,000048:                                                                                          	# 6)    DEBRIS - OTHER VEHICLE STATE VECTOR.
030480,000049:                                                                                          	# 7)    SUBROUTINES CALLED - BANKCALL, GOXDSPF, CSMPREC (OR LEMPREC), ATOPCSM (OR ATOPLEM), INTSTALL, INTWAKE, PHASCHNG
030481,000050:                                                                                          	#       INTPRET, INTEGRVS, AND MINIRECT.
030482,000051:                                                                                          	# 8)    FLAG USE - MOONFLAG, CMOONFLAG, INTYPFLG, RASFLAG, AND MARKCTR.
