034427,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Luminary 1A build 099.
034428,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Lunar Module's (LM)
034429,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
034430,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
034431,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     HARTMUTH GUTSCHE <hgutsche@xplornet.com>.
034432,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
034433,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       793-797
