040516,000021:                                                                                          	## digitized images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization
040517,000022:                                                                                          	## was performed by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of
040518,000023:                                                                                          	## the Museum.  Many thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction
