041470,000975:                                                                                          	# NAME - P51 - IMU ORIENTATION DETERMINATION
041471,000976:                                                                                          	# MOD. NO. 1    23 JAN 67                               LOG SECTION - P51-P53
041472,000977:                                                                                          	# MOD BY STURLAUGSON                                    ASSEMBLY SUNDANCE REV56
041473,000978: 
041474,000979:                                                                                          	# FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION
041475,000980:                                                                                          	#       DETERMINES THE INERTIAL ORIENTATION OF THE IMU.  THE PROGRAM IS SELECTED BY DSKY ENTRY.  THE SIGHTING
041476,000981:                                                                                          	#       (AOTMARK) ROUTINE IS CALLED TO COLLECT AND PROCESS MARKED-STAR DATA.  AOTMARK (R53) RETURNS THE STAR NUMBER AND THE
041477,000982:                                                                                          	#       STAR LOS VECTOR IN STARAD +6.  TWO STARS ARE THUS SIGHTED.  THE ANGLE BETWEEN THE TWO STARS IS THEN CHECKED AT
041478,000983:                                                                                          	#       CHKSDATA (R54).  REFSMMAT IS THEN COMPUTED AT AXISGEN.
041479,000984: 
041480,000985:                                                                                          	# CALLING SEQUENCE
041481,000986:                                                                                          	#       THE PROGRAM IS CALLED BY THE ASTRONAUT BY DSKY ENTRY.
