052208,000851:                                                                                          	# SET) IS INTEGRATED FORWARD TO PIPTIME WITH THE PRE-THRUST STATE VECTOR.
052209,000852: 
052210,000853:                                                                                          	# IN ADDITION, THE OTHER VEHICLE IS INTEGRATED (PERMANENT) TO PIPTIME.
