053668,000216:                                                                                          	# AXISGEN COMPUTES THE COORDINATES OF ONE COORDINATE SYSTEM REFERRED TO ANOTHER COORDINATE SYSTEM.
053669,000217: 
053670,000218:                                                                                          	# THE INPUTS ARE  1) THE STAR1 VECTOR REFERRED TO COORDINATE SYSTEM A STORED AT STARAD.  2) THE STAR2 VECTOR
053671,000219:                                                                                          	# REFERRED TO COORDINATE SYSTEM A STORED AT STARAD +6.  3) THE STAR1 VECTOR REFERRED TO COORDINATE SYSTEM B STORED
053672,000220:                                                                                          	# AT LOCATION 6 OF THE VAC AREA.  4) THE STAR2 VECTOR REFERRED TO COORDINATE SYSTEM B STORED AT LOCATION 12D OF
053673,000221:                                                                                          	# THE VAC AREA.
053674,000222: 
053675,000223:                                                                                          	# THE OUTPUT DEFINES COORDINATE SYSTEM A REFERRED TO COORDINATE SYSTEM B.  THE THREE HALF-UNIT VECTORS ARE STORED
053676,000224:                                                                                          	# AT LOCATIONS XDC, XDC +6, XDC +12D, AND STARAD, STARAD +6, STARAD +12D.
