057391,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Luminary 1A build 099.
057392,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Lunar Module's (LM)
057393,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
057394,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
057395,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
057396,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
057397,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       1341-1373
057398,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-27 RSB  Adapted from the corresponding 
057399,000012:                                                                                          	##                              Luminary131 file, using page 
057400,000013:                                                                                          	##                              images from Luminary 1A.
057401,000014:                                                                                          	##              2011-01-06 JL   Fixed pseudo-label indentation.
057402,000015:                                                                                          	##              2011-05-08 JL   Removed workaround.
057403,000016:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-18 RSB  Proofed text comments with octopus/ProoferComments
057404,000017:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
