057652,000265:                                                                                          	#       GOMARK1 IS USED FOR A PLEASE PERFORM ON A MARK REQUEST WITH ONLY 1 ASTRONAUT RETURN TO THE USER.  NO IMMEDIATE
057653,000266:                                                                                          	#       RETURN IS MADE.  THE DESIRED MARK PLEASE PERFORM VERB AND DESIRED NOUN IS ENTERED IN A.  GOMARK1 DISPLAYS R1, R2, R
057654,000267:                                                                                          	#       MEANS OF A V05NYY FOLLOWED BY A FLASHING V5XNYY FOR A PLEASE PERFORM.  THE ASTRONAUT WILL RESPOND WITH A MARK
057655,000268:                                                                                          	#       OR MARK REJECT OR AN ENTER.  THE ENTER IS THE ONLY ASTRONAUT RESPONSE THAT WILL COME BACK TO THE USER.
057656,000269:                                                                                          	#                               CAF     V5XNYY          X=1,2,3,4       Y=NOUN
057657,000270:                                                                                          	#                               TC      BANKCALL
057659,000272:                                                                                          	#                               CADR    GOMARK1
057660,000273:                                                                                          	#                               ...     ...             ENTER RETURN
