057995,000608:                                                                                          	# PINCHEK CHECKS TO SEE IF THE CURRENT MARK REQUEST IS MADE BY THE ASTRONAUT WHILE INTERRUPTING A GOPLAY DISPLAY
057996,000609:                                                                                          	# (A NORMAL OR A PRIO).  IF THE ASTRONAUT TRIES TO MARK DURING A PRIO, THE CHECK FAIL LIGHT GOES ON AND THE MARK
057997,000610:                                                                                          	# REQUEST IS ENDED.  IF HE TRIES TO MARK DURING A NORM, THE MARK IS ALLOWED.  IN THIS CASE THE NORM IS PUT TO SLEEP
057998,000611:                                                                                          	# UNTIL ALL MARKING IS FINISHED.
057999,000612: 
058000,000613:                                                                                          	# IF THE MARK REQUEST COMES FROM THE PROGRAM DURING A TIME THE ASTRONAUT IS NOT INTERRUPTING A NORMAL OR A
058001,000614:                                                                                          	# PRIO, THE MARK REQUEST IS PUT TO SLEEP UNTIL THE +RESENT ACTIVE DISPLAY IS RESPONDED TO BY THE ASTRONAUT.
