058858,000004:                                                                                          	## Purpose:     Part of the source code for Luminary 1A build 099.
058859,000005:                                                                                          	##              It is part of the source code for the Lunar Module's (LM)
058860,000006:                                                                                          	##              Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC), for Apollo 11.
058861,000007:                                                                                          	## Assembler:   yaYUL
058862,000008:                                                                                          	## Contact:     Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>.
058863,000009:                                                                                          	## Website:     www.ibiblio.org/apollo.
058864,000010:                                                                                          	## Pages:       1374-1380
058865,000011:                                                                                          	## Mod history: 2009-05-10 SN   (Sergio Navarro).  Started adapting
058866,000012:                                                                                          	##                              from the Luminary131/ file of the same
058867,000013:                                                                                          	##                              name, using Luminary099 page images.
058868,000014:                                                                                          	##              2016-12-18 RSB  Proofed text comments with octopus/ProoferComments
058869,000015:                                                                                          	##                              and corrected the errors found.
058870,000016:                                                                                          	##              2017-03-16 RSB  Comment-text fixes identified in 5-way
058871,000017:                                                                                          	##                              side-by-side diff of Luminary 69/99/116/131/210.
058872,000018: 
058873,000019:                                                                                          	## This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from
058874,000020:                                                                                          	## digitized images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum.  The digitization
058875,000021:                                                                                          	## was performed by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of
058876,000022:                                                                                          	## the Museum.  Many thanks to both.  The images (with suitable reduction
058877,000023:                                                                                          	## in storage size and consequent reduction in image quality as well) are
058878,000024:                                                                                          	## available online at www.ibiblio.org/apollo.  If for some reason you
058879,000025:                                                                                          	## find that the images are illegible, contact me at info@sandroid.org
058880,000026:                                                                                          	## about getting access to the (much) higher-quality images which Paul
058881,000027:                                                                                          	## actually created.
058882,000028:                                                                                          	##
058883,000029:                                                                                          	## Notations on the hardcopy document read, in part:
058884,000030:                                                                                          	##
058885,000031:                                                                                          	##      Assemble revision 001 of AGC program LMY99 by NASA 2021112-61
058886,000032:                                                                                          	##      16:27 JULY 14, 1969 
