061569,000589: 
061570,000590:                                                                                          	#                                       MANUAL RATE COMMAND MODE
061571,000591:                                                                                          	#                                       ========================
061572,000592:                                                                                          	#                                         BY ROBERT F. STENGEL
061573,000593: 
061574,000594:                                                                                          	# THIS MODE PROVIDES RCAH MANUAL CONTROL THRU 2 CONTROL LAWS:  1) DIRECT RATE AND 2) PSEUDO-AUTO.
061575,000595:                                                                                          	# THE DIRECT RATE MODE AFFORDS IMMEDIATE CONTROL WITHOUT OVERSHOOT.  THE PSEUDO-AUTO MODE PROVIDES PRECISE
061576,000596:                                                                                          	# RATE CONTROL AND ATTITUDE HOLD.
061577,000597: 
061579,000599:                                                                                          	# IN DIRECT RATE, JETS ARE FIRED WHEN STICK POSITION CHANGES BY A FIXED NUMBER OF INCREMENTS IN ONE DAP CYCLE.
061580,000600:                                                                                          	# THE 'BREAKOUT LEVEL' IS .6 D/S FOR LM-ONLY AND .3 D/S FOR CSM-DOCKED.  THIS LAW NULLS THE RATE ERROR TO WITHIN
061581,000601:                                                                                          	# THE 'TARGET DEADBAND', WHICH EQUALS THE BREAKOUT LEVEL.
061582,000602: 
061583,000603:                                                                                          	# IN PSEUDO-AUTO, BODY-FIXED RATE AND ATTITUDE ERRORS ARE SUPPLIED TO TJETLAW, WHICH EXERCISES CONTROL.
061584,000604:                                                                                          	# CONTROL SWITCHES FROM DIRECT RATE TO PSEUDO-AUTO IF THE TARGET DB IS ACHIEVED OR IF TIME IN (1) EXCEEDS 4 SEC.
061585,000605:                                                                                          	# IF THE INITIAL COMMAND DOES NOT EXCEED THE BREAKOUT LEVEL, CONTROL GOES TO PSEUDO-AUTO IMMEDIATELY.
061586,000606: 
061587,000607:                                                                                          	# SINCE P-AXIS CONTROL IS SEPARATE FROM Q,R AXES CONTROL, IT IS POSSIBLE TO USE (1) IN P-AXIS AND (2) IN Q,R AXES,
061588,000608:                                                                                          	# OR VICE VERSA.  THIS ALLOWS A DEGREE OF ATTITUDE HOLD IN UNCONTROLLED AXES.  DUE TO U,V CONTROL, HOWEVER, Q AND
061589,000609:                                                                                          	# R AXES ARE COUPLED AND MUST USE THE SAME CONTROL LAW.
061590,000610: 
061591,000611:                                                                                          	# HAND CONTROLLER COMMANDS ARE SCALED BY A LINEAR/QUADRATIC LAW.  FOR THE LM-ALONE, MAXIMUM COMMANDED RATES ARE 20
061592,000612:                                                                                          	# AND 4 D/S IN NORMAL AND FINE SCALING; HOWEVER, STICK SENSITIVITY AT ZERO COUNTS (OBTAINED AT A STICK DEFLECTION
061593,000613:                                                                                          	# OF 2 DEGREES FROM THE CENTERED POSITION) IS .5 OR .1 D/S PER DEGREE.  NORMAL AND FINE SCALINGS FOR THE CSM-DOCKED
061594,000614:                                                                                          	# CASE IS AUTOMATICALLY SET TO 1/10 THE ABOVE VALUES.  SCALING IS DETERMINED IN ROUTINE 3.
061595,000615: 
061596,000616:                                                                                          	# ZEROENBL      ENABLES COUNTERS SO THEY CAN BE READ NEXT TIME
061597,000617:                                                                                          	# JUSTOUT       FIRST DETECTION OF OUT OF DETENT (BY OURRCBIT)
