061604,000624: 16,3076           13223                           BZF      RHCMOVED                      	# BRANCH IF OUT OF DETENT.
061605,000625: 16,3077           34740                           CAF      OURRCBIT                      	# IN DETENT.  CHECK THE RATE COMMAND BIT.
