062822,000777: 
062823,000778:                                                                                          	# ROT-TOUV IS ENTERED WITH THE Q-COMPONENT OF THE QUANTITY TO BE TRANSFORMED IN A AND THE R-COMPONENT IN L.
062824,000779:                                                                                          	# ROT-TOUV TRANSFORMS THE QUANTITY INTO THE NON-ORTHOGONAL U-V AXIS SYSTEM.  IN THE U-V SYSTEM NO CROSS-COUPLING IS
062825,000780:                                                                                          	# PRODUCED FROM RCS JET FIRINGS.  AT THE COMPLETION OF ROT-TOUV, THE U-COMPONENT OF THE TRANSFORMED QUANTITY IS IN
062826,000781:                                                                                          	# A AND THE V-COMPONENT IS IN L.
